    "descriptionZh": "WEB4 OASIS 平台的 React 组件库源码，126 个组件围绕 avatar SSO、karma、NFT、quests、map、seeds、messaging、OApps 这些平台概念；这个仓库同时充当 OASIS Portal 本体及其示范站。",
    "takeawayZh": "126 个 OASIS 平台专属的 React 组件。",
    "noteZh": "README 标题是 @oasisomniverse/react — OASIS React UI Component Library，安装 npm install @oasisomniverse/react，示例代码里 <AvatarConnect apiUrl=… onLogin=… />、<Login />、<KarmaToast message=\"Quest completed\" amount={150} /> 并排摆着，并注明 All components accept an apiUrl prop that defaults to https://api.web4.oasisomniverse.one。目录分 Install、Basic Usage、Component Reference、Full Component List、Dark Space Design System、Live Demo、Links。About 侧栏补了一句 It is also the main OASIS Portal site and example site of how to build a UI on the OASIS API，演示站挂在 project-1zpdb.vercel.app；仓库只有 84 次提交、0 star、3 fork。",
